HIST [CLEAR]
  Show or clear the last CCP command. Enter two exclamation marks at A> to
  repeat the retained command. Blank, overlong, and HIST commands do not
  replace it.

VIDTEST
  Draw the S21-selected screen boundary, ASCII, active locale, and CP437 UI
  samples. The real underline cursor keeps blinking; press any key to exit.

